SUMMARY:🏁 EXAM DAY (Tentative - Adjust Per Readiness)
DESCRIPTION:Tentative AZ-104 Exam Date\n\n⚠️ ADJUST BASED ON YOUR READINESS\n\nFinal Readiness Checklist (Week 8, Friday):\n✅ Completed all 380 Anki cards (3+ times)?\n✅ 85%+ on Whizlabs exams (Weeks 4-8)?\n✅ Completed all Tutorial Dojo questions?\n✅ Can name weak areas & explain them?\n✅ Confident on Golden Rules framework?\n✅ Can draw VMSS, App Service, Storage diagrams from memory?\n✅ Know all RTO/RPO trade-offs?\n✅ Know App Service OS constraints cold?\n✅ Understand Storage redundancy options?\n✅ Master networking layer concepts?\n\nIf ALL YES: Ready to exam!\nIf ANY NO: Extend by 3-5 days, focus on that gap\n\n---\n\nPre-Exam Day (Night Before):\n✅ Light Anki review (15 min weak cards only)\n✅ No heavy study after 6 PM\n✅ Early bedtime (10 PM)\n✅ Lay out ID, exam confirmation email\n✅ Know test center location + route\n\nExam Day Morning:\n✅ 6 AM wake-up\n✅ Light breakfast (toast, fruit, coffee - nothing heavy)\n✅ Hydration (water, not soda)\n✅ Shower, calm mindset\n✅ Arrive 15 minutes early\n✅ Leave phone in car\n✅ Deep breaths in waiting area\n\nDuring Exam:\n✅ Read EVERY question carefully\n✅ Don't rush (3 hours = 1 min per question = 50 min buffer)\n✅ Mark uncertain answers for review\n✅ Time management: Don't linger on one Q\n✅ Trust your preparation\n✅ Stay calm if questions seem hard\n✅ Use all 3 hours; review every answer\n\nPost-Exam:\n✅ Take a screenshot of your score (portal shows immediately)\n✅ Celebrate! You're done! 🎉\n✅ Rest; don't obsess over individual questions\n✅ Results come via email within 24 hours\n\n---\n\nTARGET SCORE: 270+ out of 300 (90%+)\n\nYou've put in 150+ hours of study. You've got this!\n\nLet's GO! 💪🏆\n\nPost-exam: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/credentials/certifications/azure-administrator/\n(View your badge here once certified!)\nLOCATION:Testing Center\CATEGORIES:AZ-104,Exam,Final
