SUMMARY:🎴 WEEK 7 MON: Resilience & DR Deep Dive (20 cards)
DESCRIPTION:Monday - Disaster Recovery & Resilience Deep Dive\n\n📚 ANKI DECK:\n→ Resilience & Disaster Recovery Deep Dive Batch (20 cards)\n  Topics: VABRF blueprint (Vault-Access-Backup-Restore-Failover), RSV regional boundaries, Azure Backup vs ASR, ransomware recovery paths, app-consistent recovery points, VSS technology, test failover validation, commit/reprotect post-failover, monitoring replication health with Azure Monitor alerts, Action Groups automation, Azure Policy for resilience architecture\n\n🎧 REFERENCE:\n→ Resilience & Disaster Recovery Deep Dive Transcript\n  Full operational context on backup/recovery decision frameworks\n\n⏱️ Schedule:\n- 6-7 AM: Anki Resilience & DR (50 cards if available, else 20 core)\n- 7-8 AM: Continue Anki deep focus\n- 8-9 AM: Break + breakfast\n- 9-11 AM: Reference transcript for VABRF sequence understanding\n- 11-12 PM: Create recovery decision matrix (local vs regional)\n\n🎯 Goal: Master VABRF mnemonic; understand when to use Backup vs ASR\n💡 Key: Ransomware = Restore (local). Regional failure = Failover (ASR)\n\n📌 VABRF is high-probability exam content! Memorize the sequence.\n\nYou're in final 2 weeks! Focus on operational patterns.\nLOCATION:Home - Focused Study\CATEGORIES:AZ-104,Week7,Anki,DeepDive,Resilience,DR
